WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.170 --> 00:00:03.410
A third of new arrivals
die within three years,

00:00:04.310 --> 00:00:06.950
while their masters grow
rich and build grand

00:00:06.950 --> 00:00:08.690
mansions overlooking the
damned.

00:00:11.280 --> 00:00:14.790
The central square in the
image must be the

00:00:14.790 --> 00:00:16.530
master's house.

00:00:16.560 --> 00:00:18.390
The rectangular
structures we saw in the

00:00:18.390 --> 00:00:21.540
ground, that must be the
barrack blocks to

00:00:21.540 --> 00:00:23.310
accommodate the slaves.

00:00:27.950 --> 00:00:30.740
This would be a central
mill here, where the cane

00:00:30.740 --> 00:00:32.990
was crushed and the
juice would come down

00:00:32.990 --> 00:00:35.900
into refining furnaces.

00:00:36.470 --> 00:00:39.560
Accounts of sugar boiling
houses depict a steaming

00:00:39.560 --> 00:00:43.370
vision of hell, where
copper cauldrons of raw

00:00:43.370 --> 00:00:46.850
syrup bubble at 240°F.

00:00:48.250 --> 00:00:50.350
It would have been
incredibly hot.

00:00:50.380 --> 00:00:54.550
Smoke would have been
toxic and a hellhole down

00:00:54.550 --> 00:00:56.260
in this. In this mill.

